 "remarks": "Welcome to Glenbrook Glen Co-Op...the perfect blend of comfort and convenience in this Glenbrook 1-bedroom apartment with heat and hot water included! Enjoy easy one-level living featuring an open-concept living room and an updated eat-in kitchen w/granite countertops. High level details include beautiful wainscoting and crown molding throughout, a convenient office nook as well as the foyer upon entry. Recessed lights in the main living area/track lighting with sconces in the BD. The spacious bedroom with large closet w/custom built shelving system and fully updated bathroom make this one worth the wait! Storage won't be an issue with ample closet space and a large private storage cage located next to the on-site laundry. One reserved parking space #28 ensuring hassle-free parking. Enjoy a walkable lifestyle and stress-free commuting - walk to the Glenbrook Train Station as well as nearby restaurants, shops, beaches; minutes to Downtown Stamford, also convenient to I-95 and the Merritt Parkway. Don't wait...this one won't last.",
